msgid "Nothing matches."
msgstr "没有匹配项。"

#: src-tauri/src/slint_windows/model.rs
msgid "Your words go into the window as you speak, through the input method: the sentence you are speaking is shown there as text being composed, and becomes the window's text when it is finished. Your own input method (Pinyin, say) is set aside while you dictate and comes back when you finish. {} When this is off, nothing is shown before a sentence is finished."
msgstr "你说的话会通过输入法边说边进入窗口：正在说的句子以待确认文字的形式显示，说完后成为窗口中的文字。听写期间你自己的输入法（例如拼音）会暂时让位，结束后恢复。{} 关闭此项后，句子说完之前不会显示任何内容。"

#: src-tauri/src/slint_windows/model.rs
msgid "A window that takes no input method gets the words by pasting, corrected where they stand until you press a key or click."
msgstr "不接受输入法的窗口通过粘贴获得文字，在你按键或点击之前会就地更正。"

#: src-tauri/src/slint_windows/model.rs
msgid "A window that takes no input method gets each sentence pasted when it is finished."
msgstr "不接受输入法的窗口会在每句话说完后粘贴该句。"

#: src-tauri/src/slint_windows/model.rs
msgid "Your words go into the window as they are recognized, and are corrected there when a later word changes an earlier one. Heyo only ever erases what it wrote itself: once you press a key or click while dictating, it stops correcting and adds each finished sentence where the cursor is. In terminals, password managers and the applications excluded from snippet expansion, and when this is off, each sentence is pasted when it is finished."
msgstr "你说的话一经识别就进入窗口，后面的词改变了前面的内容时会就地更正。Heyo 只会擦除自己写下的内容：听写期间一旦你按键或点击，它就不再更正，而是把每句说完的话加到光标处。在终端、密码管理器和已排除文本片段展开的应用程序中，以及关闭此项时，每句话会在说完后粘贴。"

#: src-tauri/src/slint_windows/model.rs
msgid "Not available on Wayland, where Heyo cannot tell whether you typed in between, and so must not erase anything. Each sentence is pasted when it is finished."
msgstr "在 Wayland 上不可用：Heyo 无法得知你中途是否输入过内容，因此不能擦除任何文字。每句话会在说完后粘贴。"

#: src-tauri/src/slint_windows/model.rs
msgid "Not available in this desktop session. Each sentence is pasted when it is finished."
msgstr "在此桌面会话中不可用。每句话会在说完后粘贴。"

#: src-tauri/src/slint_windows/model.rs
msgid "Hold the hotkey while you speak and let go, or tap it to start and tap again to finish: what you said is typed into the window you are working in. Speech is recognized on this computer."
msgstr "按住快捷键说话，说完松开；或者按一下开始，再按一下结束：你说的话会输入到当前使用的窗口中。语音在这台电脑上识别。"

