#: src-tauri/src/slint_windows/model.rs
msgid "Names, jargon and product names, one to a line, written the way you want them: “type script” then comes out as TypeScript. For a word that is heard as something else, write heard as -> written as. The recognizer cannot be taught new words, so these are put right in its text; a Chinese name heard as other characters of the same sound is only fixed if you list those characters as “heard as”. Polishing with AI is given the list too."
msgstr "人名、术语和产品名，每行一个，按你希望的写法填写：这样“type script”就会写成 TypeScript。如果某个词总被听成别的，请写成“听成的 -> 应写的”。识别器无法学习新词，所以这些词是在识别结果中改正的；中文名字被听成同音的其他字时，只有把那些字列为“听成的”才会改正。AI 润色时也会参考这份列表。"

